step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Father Reen</col> outside <col=800000>Al Kharid</col> bank.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Father Reen outside Al Kharid bank.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel to the <col=800000>Ruins of Uzer</col> via the <col=800000>magic carpet</col> south of Al Kharid (or use the <col=800000>necklace of passage</col> teleport to <col=800000>Eagle's Eyrie</col> and run south-east). You can also use a fairy ring (DLQ) and go north-east.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Father Reen outside Al Kharid bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the Ruins of Uzer via the magic carpet south of Al Kharid (or use the necklace of passage teleport to Eagle's Eyrie and run south-east). You can also use a fairy ring (DLQ) and go north-east.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Father Badden</col> near the ruin entrance. Be sure to have Silverlight in your inventory.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Father Reen outside Al Kharid bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the Ruins of Uzer via the magic carpet south of Al Kharid (or use the necklace of passage teleport to Eagle's Eyrie and run south-east). You can also use a fairy ring (DLQ) and go north-east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Father Badden near the ruin entrance. Be sure to have Silverlight in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Pick and use a black mushroom (or black dye) on Silverlight to dye it black (you can find some beside the staircase).</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Talk to Father Reen outside Al Kharid bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the Ruins of Uzer via the magic carpet south of Al Kharid (or use the necklace of passage teleport to Eagle's Eyrie and run south-east). You can also use a fairy ring (DLQ) and go north-east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Father Badden near the ruin entrance. Be sure to have Silverlight in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick and use a black mushroom (or black dye) on Silverlight to dye it black (you can find some beside the staircase).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go down the stairs and grab a copy of the <col=800000>Strange implement</col> in the north-west corner of the ruin.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Talk to Father Reen outside Al Kharid bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the Ruins of Uzer via the magic carpet south of Al Kharid (or use the necklace of passage teleport to Eagle's Eyrie and run south-east). You can also use a fairy ring (DLQ) and go north-east.</str>
