line	
line	<str>Pick and use a black mushroom (or black dye) on Silverlight to dye it black (you can find some beside the staircase).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go down the stairs and grab a copy of the Strange implement in the north-west corner of the ruin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Evil Dave in the dungeon wearing your 3 black items and your dyed Silverlight.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Denath on the other side of the portal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Jennifer to get a demonic sigil mould.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Matthew.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to any furnace and smelt a demonic sigil (use silver bar on furnace and select 'demonic sigil').</str>
line	
line	<str>Your black outfit can now be discarded and replaced with combat gear (keep Silverlight with you).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to Uzer and talk to the clay golem outside about last night.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the nearby kilns for a book (there are four kilns – the last two are on the east side of the ruin, and by the magic carpet).</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the book, and take it to Matthew on the other side of the portal</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north and talk to Denath. (or during the ritual). Write down the incantation he tells you as it is used twice during the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Complete the circle and click the sigil in your inventory to chant the incantation (unequip the Silverlight if nothing happens).</str>
line	
line	<str>TAKE THE DEMONIC SIGIL DENATH DROPPED ON THE FLOOR. (If you do not, you will have to create another Demonic sigil)</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the portal to exit the room and take Tanya's sigil.</str>
line	
line	<str>Tell Evil Dave to return to the lair – you should have 4 sigils now.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Father Badden outside.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Convince Father Reen to join the ritual.</col>
